# re-a: the new record's own setup; re-b: the other core (arm 2 only)
# FIX = the two cores disagree on the same entry at the same load (the rule fixes' effect)
    2  F->P  FIX gain

F->P  FIX gain                                     old=contains-noun new=verified     re-a=verified     re-b=contains-noun 2 Exponentials/2.3 Exponential functions.mac e557
F->P  FIX gain                                     old=unverified   new=verified     re-a=verified     re-b=unverified   2 Exponentials/2.3 Exponential functions.mac e725
